<title>POLAND: BWR to vote on two share issues.</title>
<headline>BWR to vote on two share issues.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Poland's Bank Wspolpracy Regionalnej SA (BWR) on June 11 will vote on a proposal to raise the firm's capital through two share issues, the bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>The statement also said the shareholders would vote on whether to pay a dividend for 1996.</p>
<p>It said the shareholders would also vote on the planned merger with subsidiary Bank Secesyjny SA, which BWR intends to take over by mid-1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
